<title>INDIA: ICI in explosives venture with U.S. firm.</title>
<headline>ICI in explosives venture with U.S. firm.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>ICI India Ltd said on Friday it is forming a joint venture with Ensign-Bickford Co (EBCO) of the United States to manufacture initiating explosives systems in India.</p>
<p>The joint venture will be called Initiating Explosives Systems India Ltd and have paid up share capital of 120 million rupees, ICI India said in a statement.</p>
<p>ICI India will hold a 70 percent stake and EBCO 30 percent, it said.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
</text>
